9/11/03/lady-gaga-on-mtvs-its-on-with-alexa-chung-see-the-photos-and-watch-the-interviews/ |archive-date=November 4, 2009}}</ref> Price stated that the line "I want your ugly, I want your disease" established the grim tone of ''The Fame Monster''.<ref name="independent">{{cite news |last=Price |first=Simon |date=November 22, 2009 |title=Album: Lady Gaga, ''The Fame Monster'' (Polydor) |work=[[The Independent]] |url=https://www.independent.co.uk/arts-entertainment/music/reviews/album-lady-gaga-the-fame-monster-polydor-1825787.html |url-status=live |access-date=November 23, 2009 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20091124085219/http://www.independent.co.uk/arts-entertainment/music/reviews/album-lady-gaga-the-fame-monster-polydor-1825787.html |archive-date=November 24, 2009 |author-link=Simon Price}}</ref>

